# Pipeline-specific output dirs (added 2026-05-19, revised 2026-05-20)
# ⚠ Git limitation: "dir/**" 等同 dir excluded — !exception 無法救回內部 .md/.py/.json
# 修正: 只保留「整 tree 全 output」的 dir; 其他依賴既有 generic regex (data/, figures/, *.csv 等)
research/paired_priority_bug_audit/phaseC_*_with_significance/**
# 移除 over-broad rules (內含 source files 被誤 ignored, 共 30+ files):
