#   reports/** / v6_bam_tpfp_hp_loh_cn/** (內含 00_PLAN / 01-02_*.md)
#   v6_per_chr_alt_work/** (已被下方 *.txt override 處理)
# Override !*.txt exception for specific per-chr calculation outputs (added 2026-05-20)
