# === figures/ recursive PNG exclusion (fix from 2026-05-11) ===
# Original `**/figures/*.png` only matched direct children, missed nested figures/*/foo.png
# Recursive pattern now catches all figure PNGs regardless of depth
**/figures/**/*.png

# === Comprehensive binary policy (added 2026-05-11, post history-rewrite) ===
# Per industry standard: deliverables/binaries belong in Drive/LFS/CDN, not git.
# History rewrite reduced .git from 1.3GB to 25MB by removing these patterns.
# Pre-commit hook scripts/hooks/no_binary_commit.sh enforces this going forward.
#
# Office documents (use Google Drive / SharePoint instead)
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
# Image binaries (use figure-generation scripts; if needed, store in Drive)
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
# Allow small static logos/icons in specific dirs (negation)
!docs/assets/logo/*.png
!docs/assets/icon/*.svg
# Generated state snapshots (regenerable from source)
**/_snapshot.json
**/snapshot.json
# HTML previews (regenerable via html-preview skill)
preview/
**/preview/*.html
examples/phase1_demo/**/index.html

